76
00:01:27,957 --> 00:01:29,050
Luego muévelo.

77
00:01:29,200 --> 00:01:30,480
Regresa el pollo,

78
00:01:30,480 --> 00:01:31,386
la res, el

79
00:01:31,386 --> 00:01:32,399
